 from black\npepper."},{"source":"08_allen_encyclopedia","section":"stomach","label":"Stomach","startLine":20651,"endLine":20655,"text":"Loss of appetite. — Devouring thirst. — Violent vomiting,\nwith profuse salivation. — Gastroenteralgia.\n\nAhdomeii. — [10.] Painful sensitiveness of the whole abdomen."},{"source":"08_allen_encyclopedia","section":"stool","label":"Stool","startLine":20656,"endLine":20664,"text":"Watery diarrhoea.\n\nUrinary Organs. — Urine deep- red, depositing a sediment of urates\nof lime and soda.\n\nEesjnrafory Oryans. — Dry, oppressive cough.\n\nGeneralities. — Great feebleness of the whole body."},{"source":"08_allen_encyclopedia","section":"sleep","label":"Sleep","startLine":20665,"endLine":20666,"text":"Sleepiness."},{"source":"08_allen_encyclopedia","section":"fever","label":"Fever","startLine":20667,"endLine":20667,"text":"After a few days all the pores became opened ; profuse viscid"}],"corpusPassages":[]}